{"content_hash": "7e468a69d438c40d", "version_id": 933, "article_id": 94, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Shennong Group chairman hands ex-wife 14.88% stake as pig prices fall", "title_zh": "猪价跌不停，神农集团董事长离婚分给前妻近15%股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8198696.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554228168-dfcd8cbe15fe?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Y2hpbmVzZSUyMHBpZyUyMGZhcm1lcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0MzYwMTc2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Ben Mater on Unsplash", "author": "Ben Mater", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@benjmater?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/woman-sitting-in-front-of-pig-ek56eeYMKoQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(257, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(295, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "ce5155df2307"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-11", "word_count": 151, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "He Zuxun, chairman of Yunnan pig farmer Shennong Group, has given his ex-wife a large block of shares after their divorce. The split comes as low pork prices push the whole industry into a second slump.", "lead_zh": "云南养猪企业神农集团董事长何祖训离婚后，把一大笔股份转给了前妻。此时猪价低迷，整个行业正二次探底。", "preview": "He Zuxun transferred 78.3 million shares to Luo Wanyu, which is 30% of his holding and 14.88% of the company. At the closing price of 31.7 y", "preview_zh": "何祖训将7830.5万股转给罗婉瑜，占其持股的30%，占公司总股本的14.88%。按31.7元收盘价计算，这笔股份市值约24.8亿元。不过两人签署了一致行动协议，因此上市公司控制权没有变化。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 917, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 57.125, "size_bytes": 343728, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 57.875, "size_bytes": 348192, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 61.7, "size_bytes": 371088, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 54.0, "size_bytes": 325008, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 56.1, "size_bytes": 337536, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 172, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/94/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@315af5f/content/data/versions/933.json", "paragraphs": ["He Zuxun transferred 78.3 million shares to Luo Wanyu, which is 30% of his holding and 14.88% of the company. At the closing price of 31.7 yuan, the stake is worth about 2.48 billion yuan. However, the two signed an agreement to vote together, so control of the listed company does not change.", "Pig prices have fallen below 9 yuan per kilogram, and the industry is losing money on every pig sold. Shennong is therefore cutting costs and slowing expansion to protect its cash. In the first three quarters, revenue rose 5% to 4.12 billion yuan, although the company reported a net loss.", "The divorce also changes the family succession plan. He Zuxun's son He Xinyang has worked at Shennong since 2019 and now leads several back-office teams. However, he is not on the board and owns no shares, so he still needs more hard experience before he can take over."], "paragraphs_zh": ["何祖训将7830.5万股转给罗婉瑜，占其持股的30%，占公司总股本的14.88%。按31.7元收盘价计算，这笔股份市值约24.8亿元。不过两人签署了一致行动协议，因此上市公司控制权没有变化。", "猪价已跌破每公斤9元，行业卖一头亏一头。因此神农集团正在降本、放缓扩张，以保住现金流。前三季度营收增长5%至41.2亿元，但公司仍报亏损。", "这场离婚也改变了家族传承的安排。何祖训之子何昕阳自2019年起在神农工作，目前分管多个中后台板块。但他既不在董事会，也不持有股份，所以还需要更多硬仗历练才能接班。"], "body": "He Zuxun transferred 78.3 million shares to Luo Wanyu, which is 30% of his holding and 14.88% of the company. At the closing price of 31.7 yuan, the stake is worth about 2.48 billion yuan. However, the two signed an agreement to vote together, so control of the listed company does not change.\n\nPig prices have fallen below 9 yuan per kilogram, and the industry is losing money on every pig sold. Shennong is therefore cutting costs and slowing expansion to protect its cash. In the first three quarters, revenue rose 5% to 4.12 billion yuan, although the company reported a net loss.\n\nThe divorce also changes the family succession plan. He Zuxun's son He Xinyang has worked at Shennong since 2019 and now leads several back-office teams. However, he is not on the board and owns no shares, so he still needs more hard experience before he can take over.", "body_zh": "何祖训将7830.5万股转给罗婉瑜，占其持股的30%，占公司总股本的14.88%。按31.7元收盘价计算，这笔股份市值约24.8亿元。不过两人签署了一致行动协议，因此上市公司控制权没有变化。\n\n猪价已跌破每公斤9元，行业卖一头亏一头。因此神农集团正在降本、放缓扩张，以保住现金流。前三季度营收增长5%至41.2亿元，但公司仍报亏损。\n\n这场离婚也改变了家族传承的安排。何祖训之子何昕阳自2019年起在神农工作，目前分管多个中后台板块。但他既不在董事会，也不持有股份，所以还需要更多硬仗历练才能接班。", "text": "He Zuxun transferred 78.3 million shares to Luo Wanyu, which is 30% of his holding and 14.88% of the company. At the closing price of 31.7 yuan, the stake is worth about 2.48 billion yuan. However, the two signed an agreement to vote together, so control of the listed company does not change. Pig prices have fallen below 9 yuan per kilogram, and the industry is losing money on every pig sold. Shennong is therefore cutting costs and slowing expansion to protect its cash. In the first three quarters, revenue rose 5% to 4.12 billion yuan, although the company reported a net loss. The divorce also changes the family succession plan. He Zuxun's son He Xinyang has worked at Shennong since 2019 and now leads several back-office teams. However, he is not on the board and owns no shares, so he still needs more hard experience before he can take over.", "vocab": [{"word": "transfer", "pos": "verb", "zh": "转让", "note": "常与股份、资金搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "stake", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份；股份比例", "note": "business 常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expansion", "pos": "noun", "zh": "扩张", "note": "动词为 expand", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revenue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "营收", "note": "公司财报常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "net loss", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "净亏损", "note": "与 net profit 相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cash flow", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "现金流", "note": "保现金流 protect cash flow", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "succession", "pos": "noun", "zh": "传承；接班", "note": "家族企业常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "board", "pos": "noun", "zh": "董事会", "note": "on the board 进入董事会", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "take over", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "接管；接班", "note": "动词短语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "slump", "pos": "noun", "zh": "下滑；低迷期", "note": "也可作动词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-11T01:22:42.158123", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "He", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.425, "sm": 275, "em": 424, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Zuxun", "s": 0.425, "e": 0.9, "sm": 425, "em": 899, "cs": 3, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "transferred", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.413, "sm": 900, "em": 1412, "cs": 9, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "78.3", "s": 1.413, "e": 2.425, "sm": 1412, "em": 2424, "cs": 21, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 